{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1741.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"7a793e4a00baf20c7d56cb7ab273af596a1930892b1e10189124dcca9c8246a6","ja":"思い出せない何か","zh":"无法回忆起的某件事","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1741.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"22569c3ca608095bf69955be602ef9a2d45d37c9d76d1b63d9b726450c9b4920","ja":"春香ちゃん、撮影お疲れさま……あら？\nどうしたの？　難しい顔して。","zh":"春香，拍摄辛苦了……哎呀？\n怎么了吗？表情那么严肃。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1741.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"691914b379c2375408985a7b6ab24485c397b6ec0e0203cd3fa7e6ece5b61f6e","ja":"あっ……すみません。\n顔に出てました！？","zh":"啊……对不起。\n全都写在脸上了吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1741.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"0408a8c57ea7cac850047f827928829aed43034b426965f6036ba34d574c2ce1","ja":"ええ。何か悩みがあるのかしら？","zh":"嗯。是有什么烦恼吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1741.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"251d4b5d751b6deabda2e67a651747fc57dad3136025f78a0b49e8a46bf1ca94","ja":"実は……朝から、ずっと何かを\n忘れている気がするんです。でも、思い出せなくって。","zh":"其实……从早上开始，就一直觉得自己\n好像忘了什么事情。可是，怎么也想不起来。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1741.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"9210dc78c33a3a087c01a9a6369c7feaf3f8bd2011291f89096b0967f22c9795","ja":"とっても大事なことだった気がするんですけど……。","zh":"总觉得是件非常重要的事情来着……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1741.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"253e12a4a4bff3c72abd6fcf99912981a40c55309bed2a0c7c162a23b240a9db","ja":"そうなんだ？\nなんだか学園バトルの、春香ちゃんの役みたいね。","zh":"是这样啊？\n感觉挺像校园战斗作品里春香的角色呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1741.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"260f31f0a7e614c24887ff1fcac2e05a41af1ee5a008858fd418807f62e298df","ja":"えへへっ、そうですね♪\nでも、なんだったかなあ……？","zh":"嘿嘿，是呢♪\n不过，到底是什么来着……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1741.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"ddfe21d12d707f7b6c80ea1538ef2958672a977ab088c2962997a2edab9a542d","ja":"よかったら、一緒に考えてみない？　誰かと話したら\n何かの拍子に思い出すかもしれないわよ。","zh":"如果不介意的话，要不要一起想想看？找人聊聊的话，\n说不定就会在什么契机下想起来呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1741.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"54c83aad8c8796c116e6036e9908a515ce15c2e07c37e66f1900e2b36f16a501","ja":"えっ、いいんですか？","zh":"咦，可以吗？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1741.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"24993ef763d3e2041cf87f8ee9a04a6b5bee90a3892613dfee9974202272e1fc","ja":"お姉さんに任せなさい♪　春香ちゃんが\n悩んでるんだもの、このまま放っておけないわ。","zh":"就交给大姐姐吧♪ 毕竟春香正为这事\n烦恼着呢，我可不能就这样不管呀。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1741.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"89628df60fc707ebf8a9740142f51317857c192afb544b4a3edaf508b2e5eea4","ja":"思い出すために、最近の行動をおさらいしてみる……\nなんてどう？","zh":"为了回想起来，把最近的行动重新梳理一遍……\n你觉得怎么样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1741.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"2ff5c99184ba528bd2d1d5c3172f019f2b83ab3af1cb344dea67b502b781a7b7","ja":"はい！　えーっと、最近したことは……。","zh":"好！那个，最近做过的事是……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
